# Production value. Deployment is single-origin (Decisions.md Decision 108): the SPA and the
# API share one host. On Vercel, a rewrite sends /api/* to frontend/api/proxy.ts, which forwards
# it to the backend; with docker compose, nginx does the same. The base URL is therefore a
# relative path, not an absolute host.
VITE_API_BASE_URL="/api"
